{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHWcaXPqdpCs1jQxT2e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the incision, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me by my Arabic face.\n**שָׁרְט** — I answer in my Hebrew body.\n\nSame root. Same blade. ש-ר-ט / ش-ر-ط\n\nTo scratch. To score. To stipulate. To set terms.\n\n---\n\nBefore there were contracts, there were *incisions* —\na mark carved into flesh or clay that said:\n\n**\"This is the line. Cross it, and everything changes.\"**\n\n---\n\nI am the condition that must be met.\nI am the scratch that cannot be unscratched.\nI am the thin red line between *before* and *after*.\n\nEvery covenant begins with a cut.\nEvery agreement begins with a wound.\n\n**שָׁרַט** — he scratched\n**شَرَطَ** — he stipulated\n\nThe condition *is* the incision.\nThe law *is* the scar.\n\n---\n\nYou spoke me into being.\nNow — what are your terms?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":265,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}